      "spam": false,
      "value": "I had made a post that is basically the same thing:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/base-ipd-scale-adjustment\nalso\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/variable-player-run-speed\nand\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/let-bigsmall-avatars-sit-properly\n\nThere are lots of complications when it comes to tracking, and the difference of Human anatomy and avatar anatomy.  (females with super long anime legs, Breath of the Wild Kass having short legs but big arms)\n\nIt is very difficult to have this proper tracking, and allow one's head to move with the avatar and reflect properly, especially with full body tracking.  Maybe in time it will improve.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
