      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59b9afc4e46c3651b53cf856|full_name}: It would be challenge for sure, i know nothing of programming but maybe the idea of making the trackers move relative to the avatar is a new angle, i dont know :)\n\nWhen calibrating arm span by standing in t-pose the game could be told where shoulder height is relative to head by drawing a line between the controllers as well which should help.",
